    "body": "If I want to convert a form into an object, I may implement a simple solution... something like\n\n``` javascript\n      // convert the form into an object\n      var formObj = {};\n      for (var i = 0; i < form.length; i++) {\n        if (form[i].id) {\n          formObj[form[i].id] = form[i].value;\n        }\n      }\n```\n\n@annevk, thanks for the information.\n",
